STRATEGY trend VERSION 1

# Trend-following child. Buys pullbacks to a rising SMA when the portfolio
# has selected the trend regime. The exact entry rule is intentionally simple
# so the example stays readable.

SYMBOLS
    btc = BACKTEST:BTCUSDT EVERY 1h

RULES
    WHEN btc.close > sma(btc.close, 20) AND POSITION.btc = 0
    THEN BUY btc SIZING 1 PCT RISK BRACKET { STOP LOSS PCT 5, TAKE PROFIT AT 200 }
